<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Green Prop sells UK estate for 11.75 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Green Prop sells UK estate for 11.75 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish property group Green Property said on Monday that it has sold its industrial estate at Stacey Bushes, Milton Keynes, to MEPC for 11.75 million sterling, an initial yield of 9.9 percent.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that the estate comprises some 320,000 square feet of industrial warehouses adjacent to the A5 road.</p>
<p>&quot;This sale underlines our ability to add value through active management,&quot; Stephen Vernon, Managing Director of Green Property said.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom 661337</p>
</text>
